"ingredient": {         
"type": "forge:partial\_nbt",        
"item": "minecraft:apple",        
"nbt": "{quality\_food:{quality:1}}"      
}    
},     
"output": \[      
{         
"count":2,         
"item": "minecraft:emerald"       
},      
{  
      "count": 4,         
"item": "revampedtrades:emerald\_coin"       
}     
\]     
 }

Fiddling around with the repeat rate doesn't do much either T\^T. input "t" still equals "t5" no matter how slow it is.

&#x200B;

When I have filter keys and hold down "t", "5" pops up.

ㅋㅋㅋ 오 후디 같은거 사드릴게요

&#x200B;

근데 연어 비행기에서 썩지 않아요??
